# Response headers for hosts that read a _headers file (Netlify; Cloudflare Pages too, but its 25 MiB file limit is below the
# evo-sdk WASM's size). GitHub Pages ignores this file: at
# gov.dashhq.org the same framing headers need a Cloudflare response-header Transform Rule on the proxied zone; the app itself
# refuses to offer a ?config= link inside a frame (app/Layout.tsx isFramed). A <meta> CSP cannot set frame-ancestors.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
